{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Mandate all schools to provide outdoor learning & teach hands-on gardening",
        "additional_details": "We feel our children are disconnected from nature and unprepared for a changing planet. Outdoor learning could improve mental health, reduce eco-anxiety and teach vital self-sufficiency. Textbooks alone cannot protect our future. We should give the next generation the practical tools and ecological literacy they need to survive.",
        "background": "We call on the Government to mandate all schools to provide outdoor learning and teach hands-on gardening to build vital survival skills and fight climate anxiety. We believe our children need nature, and that this proposal can protect their future and Earth.",
